.TH GENETREE 1 2000-1月 "feature_importance" "feature_importance"
.SH NAME
feature_importance \- Get the split importance of the regulators, this table is the data driven
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIfeature_importance(\fBtree\fR as <generic> XGBoostGRN, 
\fBtop_n\fR as integer = 20, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Get the split importance of the regulators, this table is the data driven
 "sign and weight" of the ARACNE network edges.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBtree\fB \fR\- the trained [XGBoostGRN](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.GeneTree.XGBoostGRN) model object.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBtop_n\fB \fR\- 
 the number of the regulator records that are ordered by the sensitivity in
 descending order, \fB0\fR returns all of them.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment object.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a dataframe whose columns are \fBgene\fR, \fBregulator\fR, \fBrank\fR, \fBmi\fR,
 \fBcorrelation\fR, \fBsplits\fR and \fBsensitivity\fR.
.PP
